+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+/*!
+* \brief
+*
+* \param[in/out] The input variable pointed by pucNumOfChannel is the max
+*                arrary size. The return value indciates meaning list size.
+*
+* \return none
+*/
+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
